<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian rubber market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Indonesian rubber market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indonesian rubber market is closed on Thursday for the Buddhist Wesak holiday. The market will resume on Friday.</p>
<p>The benchmark SIR20 offer prices for August shipment were quoted on Wednesday at 47.50 U.S. cents/lb fob Palembang, 47.75 fob Medan and Surabaya, 47.25 fob Padang and 47.00 fob Pontianak and Jambi.</p>
<p>-- Lewa Pardomuan, Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
